# Classroom IPv4 isolation template; interface en0. Load only in the scoped project anchor.
pass in quick on en0 inet proto tcp from 10.7.16.25 to 10.7.17.47 port 3001 flags S/SA keep state label "cn-a-edge-allow"
block return in quick on en0 inet proto tcp from any to 10.7.17.47 port 3001 label "cn-a-client-block"
